    website: https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammad-alkhenizan-537623257
abstract: >-
  laya-ara is a research fine-tune of convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual
  for Arabic typed decisions (choice, score, noul) using official Laya
  RLCD. MASSIVE-ar 20-option intent rises 0.386 to 0.816 (+111% relative
  to stock). The mix includes facebook/xnli (CC BY-NC 4.0).
